OL,3,GNEWSAMicrosoft outage: Yorkshire
OL,4,Acouncils and police hit
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncils, police forces and hospitals
OL,7,Facross Yorkshire have been affected as
OL,8,Fpart of a global Microsoft outage which
OL,9,Fhas been going on for almost a day.
OL,11,FTools including Teams, Outlook and AI
OL,12,Fsoftware Copilot have all been
OL,13,Faffected, causing disruption for tens
OL,14,Fof thousands of people.
OL,16,FCity of York Council, Bradford Council,
OL,17,FWest Yorkshire Police, South Yorkshire
OL,18,FPolice and York and Scarborough
OL,19,FTeaching Hospitals NHS Foundations
OL,20,FTrust all said they were among the
OL,21,Forganisations affected.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
